{
 "id": "mk-c1-1",
 "src": "估價_綜合模擬卷一.html",
 "idx": 0,
 "group": "income",
 "q_html": "一、試依「不動產估價技術規則」說明收益法之意義、應用時機及估價程序。並就下列資料，以直接資本化法求算該收益性不動產之收益價格：<br><br>\n      【已知條件】<br>\n      ・年可能總收入：1,200萬元<br>\n      ・空租損失率：5%<br>\n      ・年費用（含管理費、折舊、稅捐）：180萬元<br>\n      ・土地價值占不動產總值之50%，土地資本化率3.5%<br>\n      ・建物價值占不動產總值之50%，建物資本化率7.5%<br>\n      請先求算綜合資本化率，再求算收益價格。（25分）",
 "ans_html": "<div class=\"ans-block\">\n        <h4>一、收益法之意義</h4>\n        <p>收益法係將勘估標的未來所能產生之淨收益，以適當之資本化率予以資本化，或以折現率折現，以求取勘估標的價格之估價方法（技術規則§28：直接資本化法、折現現金流量法）。</p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ans-block\">\n        <h4>二、應用時機</h4>\n        <ul>\n          <li>具有穩定收益之出租型不動產（辦公室、商場、廠辦）</li>\n          <li>具有租賃市場之住宅（公寓、套房出租）</li>\n          <li>收益型不動產之合理性驗證</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ans-block\">\n        <h4>三、估價程序（直接資本化法）</h4>\n        <ol>\n          <li>蒐集總收入、總費用及資本化率或折現率等資料（最近三年，§35）</li>\n          <li>推算有效總收入（§36）</li>\n          <li>推算總費用（§38～§41，含建物折舊提存費）</li>\n          <li>計算淨收益（§42：有效總收入－總費用）</li>\n          <li>決定收益資本化率或折現率（§43 五法；房地綜合資本化率依土地、建物價值比率加權，§46）</li>\n          <li>計算收益價格（§30：P＝a÷r）</li>\n        </ol>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"ans-block\">\n        <h4>四、計算過程</h4>\n        <div class=\"cbox\"><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">年有效總收入</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">1,200</span><span class=\"kf-op\">×</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">(1 ─ 5%)</span></div><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">1,200</span><span class=\"kf-op\">×</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">0.95</span></div><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\"><strong>1,140 萬元</strong></span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"cbox\"><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">年淨收益</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">有效總收入</span><span class=\"kf-op\">─</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">費用</span></div><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">1,140</span><span class=\"kf-op\">─</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">180</span></div><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\"><strong>960 萬元</strong></span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"cbox\"><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">綜合資本化率</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">3.5%</span><span class=\"kf-op\">×</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">50%</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＋</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">7.5%</span><span class=\"kf-op\">×</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">50%</span></div><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">1.75%</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＋</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">3.75%</span></div><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\"><strong>5.5%</strong></span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"cbox\"><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">收益價格</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">年淨收益</span><span class=\"kf-op\">÷</span><span class=\"kf-c k-g\">綜合資本化率</span><span class=\"kf-op\">＝</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\">960</span><span class=\"kf-op\">÷</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\">5.5%</span></div></div>\n        <div class=\"cbox\"><div class=\"kf-eq\"><span class=\"kf-c k-s\">收益價格</span><span class=\"kf-op\">≈</span><span class=\"kf-c k-m\"><strong>17,455 萬元（約 1.75 億元）</strong></span></div></div>\n      </div>"
}